Hello,

I'm working on BBC Radio 4's technology series 'The Digital Human'.

We're making an episode about Language, and are interested in the
possibility of featuring a segment on the development of Lojban and how
the community of Lojban volunteers use the language today.

If I could give one of your members a call tomorrow it would be great to
ask a few questions and tell them more about our series. Of course I'd
be happy to answer any questions but if you want any more information in
the meantime please check out our website -
http://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/b01n7094  and our Tumblr -
http://thedigitalhuman.tumblr.com

Best wishes,

